==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From being a {{l|en|channel}} separating {{l|en|England|gloss=English}} from the mainland.

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun|head=[[English]] [[channel|Channel]]}}

# The arm of the [[Atlantic Ocean]] that separates the [[British Isles]] from northern [[France]], and joins the [[North Sea]] to the [[Atlantic Ocean]].

====Synonyms====
* [[the Channel]]
* {{l|en|British Sea}} {{qualifier|archaic}}

